BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.426435 Tw (Automation is a central feature of low-code platforms. Rules, triggers and scheduled actions can perform) Tj T* 0 Tw .181939 Tw (repetitive tasks without manual effort. Because much of the routine programming is handled by the platform,) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.153161 Tw (development effort is reduced and applications can be delivered faster. Low-code platforms are also) Tj T* 0 Tw .247623 Tw (accessible to a wider group of people: professional developers use them to speed up their work, and business) Tj T* 0 Tw (users with limited programming experience can take part in building simple applications.) Tj T* ET
